<title>UK: LME lists Finnish nickel brand.</title>
<headline>LME lists Finnish nickel brand.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The London Metal Exchange (LME) has listed the nickel brand &quot;Outokumpu Nickel Briquettes' produced by Finnish producer Outokumpu Harjavalta Metal Oy, an Exchange notice said.</p>
<p>The brand will constitute good delivery against LME contracts with immediate effect.</p>
<p>London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7771</p>
</text>
